# A write through an atom writes the field of the Structure the atom names, one instance (the author 2026-11-11; plan
# M11 5a): after `Struct1\Struct2\v := 7` the place v of Struct2 holds 7. The mention stands above the declaration.
# Plan M11 5v: the declarations of ordinary Structures live in the data part of main; the root holds places and the call main().
sub: main () (
    Struct1: Struct2
    Struct2:
        int: v 4
)
    Struct1\Struct2\v := 7
main()
int: seen main\data\Struct2\v
